#: .\account_app\templates\legal\privacy_policy.html:15
msgid "What we collect"
msgstr ""

#: .\account_app\templates\legal\privacy_policy.html:16
msgid ""
"To create and run your IfiPlatform account, we store your username, email "
"address, and first and last name. You can optionally set a nickname to be "
"credited under instead of your real name. We also use a session cookie to "
"keep you logged in -- this is strictly necessary for the site to work and "
"isn't a tracking cookie."
msgstr ""

#: .\account_app\templates\legal\privacy_policy.html:18
msgid "Why we collect it"
msgstr ""

#: .\account_app\templates\legal\privacy_policy.html:19
msgid ""
"This data is used to create and secure your account, verify your email "
"address, let you write and be credited for articles/news and own study "
"decks, and reach you if we need to (e.g. a security notice). The legal basis "
"is contract necessity: we need it to provide the account-based features you "
"sign up for."
msgstr ""

#: .\account_app\templates\legal\privacy_policy.html:21
msgid "Cookies and third parties"
msgstr ""

#: .\account_app\templates\legal\privacy_policy.html:22
msgid ""
"IfiPlatform does not use any analytics, advertising, or tracking scripts, "
"and does not share your data with any third party. The only cookies in use "
"are Django's own session and CSRF cookies, required for login and form "
"security."
msgstr ""

#: .\account_app\templates\legal\privacy_policy.html:24
msgid "How long we keep it"
msgstr ""

#: .\account_app\templates\legal\privacy_policy.html:25
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your account data is kept until you delete your account (see \"Your rights\" "
"below). If you sign up but never confirm your email address, that unverified "
"account -- and the name/email on it -- is automatically deleted after "
"%(retention_days)s days."
msgstr ""

#: .\account_app\templates\legal\privacy_policy.html:27
msgid "Content ownership for articles and news"
msgstr ""

#: .\account_app\templates\legal\privacy_policy.html:28
msgid ""
"Info articles and news you write on IfiPlatform become the property of "
"IfiPlatform and the student union(s) it represents -- they aren't deleted if "
"you later delete your account, since they're institutional content, not "
"personal data about you. What does stay your choice is how they're credited: "
"under your real name, your nickname, or anonymously as \"Unknown\". You'll "
"be asked to explicitly agree to this the first time you're given permission "
"to write pages; if you disagree, that permission is removed again."
msgstr ""

#: .\account_app\templates\legal\privacy_policy.html:30
#, fuzzy
